ator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133156495,imgsize-84050.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Maryland's first human composting facility offers an alternative to burial and cremation]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133156114.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Maryland has introduced an innovative option for end-of-life choices with natural organic reduction. Located in Elkridge, a new facility offers a sustainable alternative to traditional burial and cremation methods. This eco-friendly process converts human remains into nutrient-dense soil in about a month. Families can either keep the soil or contribute it to projects focusing on land conservation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/marylands-first-human-composting-facility-offers-an-alternative-to-burial-and-cremation-through-natural-organic-reduction/articleshow/133156114.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/marylands-first-human-composting-facility-offers-an-alternative-to-burial-and-cremation-through-natural-organic-reduction/articleshow/133156114.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-11T19:04:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133156229,imgsize-195890.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Malaysia's Princess Ilyana marries British GT racer Chris Froggatt in Kuala Lumpur]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133152388.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Tengku Puteri Raja Tengku Puteri Ilyana Alia, daughter of Pahang Sultan Al-Sultan Abdullah, married British racing driver Christopher Lionel Froggatt in Kuala Lumpur on August 7. The ceremony was attended by members 